### Before                                   ### After
POST /getUsers                               GET    /v1/users?role=admin&limit=50&cursor=…
POST /createUser                             POST   /v1/users                        → 201 + Location
POST /updateUserEmail?id=7                   PATCH  /v1/users/7  {"email": "…"}     → 200
GET  /deleteUser?id=7                        DELETE /v1/users/7                      → 204
POST /getUserOrders?id=7                     GET    /v1/users/7/orders               → 200
POST /resetPassword?id=7                     POST   /v1/users/7/password-resets      → 202
GET  /user?id=999  → 200 {"error":"none"}    GET    /v1/users/999                    → 404 problem+json

### Rules applied
# plural nouns · ids in the path · filters/paging in the query · GET never changes state
# precise status codes · one error format (problem+json) · version prefix · no verbs except for
# action sub-resources that are themselves things (password-resets, refunds, cancellations)
